more information, see SAP Note <a href=\\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\\" rel=\\"nofollow\\">3188446</a></p>\\n<p><strong>Product Features:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n <li>Create Folders</li>\\n <li>Create Lists</li>\\n <li>Create List items</li>\\n <li>Update Columns</li>\\n <li>Download Files</li>\\n <li>Upload Files</li>\\n <li>Create Content Types</li>\\n <li>Retrieve Site information</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n <li>Oauth2 Authorization Code.</li>\\n <li>OAuth2 Client Credentials.</li>\\n <li>Dynamic header and property support in the receiver adapter.</li>\\n <li>Desired response type from SharePoint (JSON or XML).</li>\\n</ul></p>","shortText":"Microsoft SharePoint adapter is used to create and manage Files, Folders, Lists and List Items in SharePoint application by SAP Cloud Integration.","version":"1.0.3","vendor":"SAP","mode":"READ_ONLY","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1738927290466","modifiedDate":"1738927290482","createdBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"Microsoft,MicrosoftSharePoint,SAPCloudPlatformIntegration,SAPCloudPlatformIntegrationSuite","keywords":"Adapter,Adapter for SAP,Integration Suite,Microsoft SharePoint,Microsoft SharePoint Adapter,Microsoft SharePoint Suite,SAP Integration Suite,Suite","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"ee33ef8e4d5c445bb566a31736d3bda9","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":true,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'MicrosoftSharePointAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"MicrosoftTeamsAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite","name":"Microsoft Teams Adapter for SAP Integration Suite","description":"<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">The Microsoft Teams adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time and reduces the complexity of connecting to Microsoft Teams. The adapter is available only for Standard service plans and above of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note&nbsp;<a href=\\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\\" rel=\\"nofollow\\">3188446</a>.</span></p>\\n<ul>\\n <li style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">Supports standard operations for various Microsoft Teams resources like&nbsp;</span><strong>Channel</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">, </span><strong>Team</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">, </span><strong>Member</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">, </span><strong>Message</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">, and </span><strong>Chat</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">.</span></span></li>\\n <li style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">Supports secure and reliable authentication methods:&nbsp;<strong>OAuth2 Authorization Code</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\"> and </span><strong>OAuth2 Client Credentials</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">.</span></span></li>\\n <li style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">Supports&nbsp;<strong>querying</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\"><strong> </strong>on resources to retrieve the </span>desired output<span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\"> as per your requirements.</span></span></li>\\n <li style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">Supports&nbsp;<strong>pagination</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\"><strong> </strong>using the </span><strong>Get next results page</strong> <span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">operation.</span></span></li>\\n <li style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">Flexibility to perform operations at the user level (<strong>Delegated Permission</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">) and organization/admin level (</span><strong>Application Permission</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">).</span></span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><strong>Documentation:</strong></span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">All documentation, including the User Guide, and Release Notes are included in the documentation tab of this package.</span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><strong>Download Location:</strong></span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">&nbsp;To install the Adapter, refer to the Adapter Guide located in the Documents tab.</span></p>","shortText":"This package includes the Microsoft Teams Adapter and its documentation. The Microsoft Teams Adapter is available on SAP Integration Suite. It facilitates and accelerates implementation time and reduces the complexity of connecting to Microsoft Teams.","version":"1.0.0","vendor":"SAP","mode":"READ_ONLY","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1762862145583","modifiedDate":"1762862145589","createdBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"MicrosoftTeams","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"dbef64f7444b48ab998db15338d106de","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":false,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'MicrosoftTeamsAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"MigratingInterfaceFTFSD","name":"MigratingInterface_FTF_SD","description":"<p></p>","shortText":"Migrating interfaces from SAP PIPO to SAP CPI","version":"1.0.1","vendor":"","mode":"EDIT_ALLOWED","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"s.shaik@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1763120251818","modifiedDate":"1763120251820","createdBy":"s.shaik@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"b389f4c1854f4d53ae6ed5d6f5dce7e2","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":false,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'MigratingInterfaceFTFSD\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"migration","name":"migration","description":"<p></p>","shortText":"testing","version":"","vendor":"","mode":"EDIT_ALLOWED","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"s.ummaka@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1724328856784","modifiedDate":"1724328856787","createdBy":"s.ummaka@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"01f9e74427904729971685478e02e424","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":false,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'migration\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"Migrationassessment","name":"Migrationassessment","description":"<p></p>","shortText":"Migrating PO interfaces to CPI","version":"","vendor":"","mode":"EDIT_ALLOWED","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"s.shaik@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1760100883680","modifiedDate":"1760100883683","createdBy":"s.shaik@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"f4cc67ba50884c62ab5d01f9d5055f85","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":false,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'Migrationassessment\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"MigrationUDFS","name":"MigrationUDFS","description":"<p></p>","shortText":"UDFS migrating date and PO amount individually","version":"","vendor":"","mode":"EDIT_ALLOWED","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"s.shaik@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1760120521836","modifiedDate":"1760120521840","createdBy":"s.shaik@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"f945b8cd8ada4bf7ad8bb3b76eb7e64c","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":false,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'MigrationUDFS\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"NaveenPOCTrail","name":"Naveen_POC_Trail","description":"<p></p>","shortText":"Developing POC\'S Using Different scenerios.","version":"1.0","vendor":"Sierra","mode":"EDIT_ALLOWED","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"n.bandi@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1723017313809","modifiedDate":"1723017313812","createdBy":"n.bandi@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"2de5e85014cc405ab8d5b8583541bfce","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":false,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'NaveenPOCTrail\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"NetSuiteAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite","name":"NetSuite Adapter for SAP Integration Suite","description":"<p><span style=\\"font-size: 14pt\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 12pt\\">The NetSuite adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time of connecting to NetSuite. The adapter is available only for Standard service plans and above of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note <a href=\\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\\" rel=\\"nofollow\\">3188446</a>.</span>&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p><strong>Feature highlights:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n <li style=\\"text-align: left\\"><strong>Support for multiple API versions</strong>: NetSuite supports multiple API versions with an editable API version field enabling users to input the latest supported version.</li>\\n <li style=\\"text-align: left\\"><strong>Secure authentication based on Tokens</strong>: The NetSuite adapter supports the Token-Based Authentication (TBA) mechanism which increases overall system security. Every call between NetSuite and SAP Cloud Integration is secured by Tokens.</li>\\n <li style=\\"text-align: left\\"><strong>Support for multiple NetSuite operations</strong>: The NetSuite adapter supports various operations like Add, Attach, Add List, Get, Get List, Delete, Get All, Get Saved Search, Async Add List, Update, Update List, Upsert List, etc.</li>\\n <li style=\\"text-align: left\\"><strong>Querying and searching</strong>: In addition to all the operations that the NetSuite Adapter offers, the Adapter allows the querying of data from your NetSuite tenant.</li>\\n <li style=\\"text-align: left\\"><strong>Dynamic configuration with headers and properties</strong>: Assigning dynamic values to different properties allows enhanced flexibility to your integration flows. You can also refer to dynamic parameters using SAP Cloud Integration exchange headers and properties.&nbsp;</li>\\n <li style=\\"text-align: left\\"><strong>Processing more than one record at a time</strong>: Some operations can be performed on one or more new instances of a record in NetSuite. In most cases, these operations contain the word List in them. As an example, the addlist operation can be used to add one or more new instances of a record to NetSuite.</li>\\n <li style=\\"text-align: left\\"><strong>Processing more than one record of data asynchronously</strong>: Some operations can be performed on one or more new instances of a record in NetSuite in an asynchronous manner. In general, for asynchronous operations, bulk records are sent to NetSuite without the need to wait for a response.</li>\\n <li style=\\"text-align: left\\"><strong>XSD Generator</strong>: To help speed up the integration, an XSD generator in the form of an Eclipse Plug-in is provided alongside the adapter. With this Eclipse Plug-in/Workbench, it is possible to generate an XSD which includes the structure of an Account Record. The generated XSD can then be imported into Cloud Integration and used for mapping purposes.</li>\\n <li style=\\"text-align: left\\"><strong>Full integration support for Custom Records and Fields</strong>: In addition to supporting all the standard NetSuite Records (or entities), the Adapter integrates with all the Custom Objects in NetSuite, providing support for custom fields in the objects as well.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Documentation:</strong></p>\\n<p>All documentation, including the User Guide, and Release Notes are included in the documentation tab of this package.</p>\\n<p><strong>Download Location:</strong></p>\\n<p>To download the SAP NetSuite Adapter\'s Eclipse Plug-In or Workbench, navigate to:&nbsp;<a href=\\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/softwarecenter\\" rel=\\"nofollow\\">https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/softwarecenter</a>&nbsp;&gt;&gt; SUPPORT PACKAGES &amp; PATCHES By Alphabetical Index (A-Z) &gt;&gt;&nbsp;C &gt;&gt;&nbsp;look for “<strong>SAP CP IS ADAPTER ADVANCE PACK</strong>”.</p>\\n<p>Alternatively, you can directly go to:</p>\\n<ul>\\n <li><a href=\\"https://eur03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flaunchpad.support.sap.com%2F%23%2Fsoftwarecenter%2Ftemplate%2Fproducts%2F_APP%3D00200682500000001943%26_EVENT%3DNEXT%26HEADER%3DY%26FUNCTIONBAR%3DY%26EVENT%3DTREE%26NE%3DNAVIGATE%26ENR%3D73555000100800003071%26V%3DMAINT%26TA%3DACTUAL%2FSAP%2520CP%2520IS%2520ADAPTER%2520ADVANCE%2520PACK&amp;data=04%7C01%7Cjohn.bilay%40rojoconsultancy.com%7C514b303c7b6a4903e49708d8a0d0c4f2%7C920d0ff2113441eca952e6c5ca6532c1%7C0%7C0%7C637436165801744392%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C1000&amp;sdata=hr4z9GRGDN1%2FhvvE1i%2FmyqbGhUotS5hK%2BjtuBPejytw%3D&amp;reserved=0\\" rel=\\"nofollow\\">SAP CP IS ADAPTER ADVANCE PACK</a></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Please note that the content of the package is the Eclipse Plug-In or Workbench. To install the Adapter, refer to the Adapter Guide located in the Documents tab.</p>","shortText":"This package include the NetSuite Adapter and its documentation. The NetSuite adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time of connecting to NetSuite.","version":"1.0.0","vendor":"SAP","mode":"READ_ONLY","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"d.malarmani@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1724748544004","modifiedDate":"1724748544013","createdBy":"d.malarmani@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"NetSuite,SAPCloudPlatformIntegrationSuite","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesi