:{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'nihapocflows\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"OpenAIChatGPTPurchaseOrderNotification","name":"OpenAI ChatGPT Integration with SAP S/4HANA and Microsoft","description":"<p>This interface reads an email inbox that is receiving requisition from customers that wants to know the overall status of the purchase order. After reading the email, it sends the mail body to OpenAI ChatGPT so it recognizes what is the Purchase Order number. With this value, the IFlow then captures the overall status from SAP S/4HANA using API and replies to the customer with this information, using OpenAI ChatGPT to build a meaningful email.</p>\\n<p>It contains 1 Integration Flow (IFlow) and 1 Value Mapping.</p>\\n<ul>\\n <li>OpenAI ChatGPT with SAP S/4HANA PurchaseOrder Status Notification &nbsp;– The main interface that captures the mail body, integrates with OpenAI ChatGPT and SAP S/4HANA and then replies to the email with the overall status.</li>\\n <li>OpenAI Status Description Value Mappings – This value mapping contains all possible status codes and status descriptions from SAP S/4HANA.</li>\\n</ul>","shortText":"This integration package reads an email inbox for customers who require assistance with the delivery status of a specific purchasing document and uses OpenAI ChatGPT to build meaningful emails as a response to the customer.","version":"1.0.0","vendor":"Crave InfoTech","mode":"EDIT_ALLOWED","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"p.karthikeyan@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1739355740716","modifiedDate":"1739355740732","createdBy":"p.karthikeyan@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"ChatGPT,CraveInfotech,Google,MicrosoftOutlook,SAP S/4HANA","keywords":"ChatGPT,Microsoft,S/4HANA","countries":"USA","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"Technology Area Enterprise Technology","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesign